### 4. Get existing ticket
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets/6a6c2862bbb9c4921833f6e2


### 5. Get missing ticket
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets/000000000000000000000000


### 6. Create a valid ticket
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "VPN connection not working",
  "description": "User cannot connect to company VPN from home.",
  "category": "Network",
  "priority": "MEDIUM",
  "createdBy": "siti@example.com"
}


### 7. Create an invalid ticket
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "description": "",
  "category": "",
  "priority": "",
  "createdBy": ""
}

### Filter tickets by status
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets?status=OPEN


### Filter tickets by priority
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets?priority=HIGH


### Filter tickets by category
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets?category=Email


### Paged tickets - default page size
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets/paged?page=0&size=5


### Paged tickets - second page, default size
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets/paged?page=1&size=5


### Paged tickets - sorted by createdAt descending
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets/paged?page=0&size=5&sortBy=createdAt&direction=desc


### Paged tickets - first page, 2 per page
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets/paged?page=0&size=2


### Paged tickets - second page, 2 per page
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets/paged?page=1&size=2


### Test 1: Invalid status value
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets?status=INVALID


### Test 2: Invalid priority value
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets?priority=URGENT


### Test 3: Page number with no records
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets/paged?page=99&size=5


### Test 4: Very large page size
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets/paged?page=0&size=100


### Test 5: Unknown sort field
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets/paged?page=0&size=5&sortBy=unknownField&direction=asc


### Test 6: Combined filters
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets?status=OPEN&priority=HIGH


