### 3d. Create ticket with ADMIN token, should return 201
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tickets
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Test ticket as admin",
  "description": "Testing admin-only creation",
  "category": "Network",
  "priority": "LOW",
  "createdBy": "aina.rahman@example.com"
}